| Feature | Surface (2D) | Multi-Level (3D) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Grid State ($x$)** | 2D Spatial Grid ($N_{lat} \times N_{lon}$) | 3D Spatial-Vertical Mesh ($N_{lat} \times N_{lon} \times N_{lev}$) |
| **Obs Source** | `conv-adpsfc` (single surface level) | `conv-adpupa` (profiles across pressure levels) |
| **Vertical Metric** | N/A | Log-pressure distance ($\Delta \ln p$) |
| **Control Transform** | $\mathbf{L}_H$ (2D Cholesky) | Kronecker product $\mathbf{L}_H \otimes \mathbf{L}_V$ |


